<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Sugar On My Tongue</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Tyler, The Creator</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DON'T TAP THE GLASS</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6xV7Be6XEvkSnighmh2Tzj</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.560" end="00:02.060">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.903" end="00:03.796">Ah-ah-ah-ah (Eh, eh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.796" end="00:07.785">Ah-ah-ah-ah (Eh, eh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.785" end="00:11.730">Ah-ah-ah-ah (Eh, eh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.730" end="00:13.230">Ah-ah-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.038" end="00:14.538" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.805" end="00:15.305">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.145" end="00:18.045">Like sugar on my tongue, tongue, tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.045" end="00:21.521">Your body is so sweet, sweet, sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.521" end="00:25.563">Invite me if you come, come, come (Come)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.563" end="00:27.063">It's all I want to eat, eat, eat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.317" end="00:27.817" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.550" end="00:29.050">[Refrain]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.860" end="00:31.733">Tell your mama (Tell 'em, boy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.733" end="00:33.551">Tell your daddy (Tell 'em, boy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.551" end="00:35.869">Tell the bitches that you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.869" end="00:37.369">What you heard about me? (Uh-huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.167" end="00:39.009">Tell your mama (Tell your mama)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.009" end="00:40.828">Tell your daddy (Tell your daddy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.828" end="00:42.328">Tell the world (Uh), tell the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.805" end="00:43.305" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.198" end="00:45.177">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.177" end="00:49.199">Like sugar on my tongue (Cannot stay away from you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.199" end="00:51.580">Like sugar on my tongue (Cannot stay away from you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.580" end="00:53.446" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.446" end="00:58.983">[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.983" end="01:04.450">Are you from Mars? Make your arms and legs shake, uh-huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.450" end="01:08.318">Give me that slice of cream, is it your birthday? Uh-huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.318" end="01:11.830">I got a brush, give me your wallet, I'll pay, uh-huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.830" end="01:13.330">Don't need no air, I stay down there 'til I say, well, I'm dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.072" end="01:14.572" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.836" end="01:15.336">[Refrain]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.200" end="01:18.108">Tell your mama (Tell 'em, boy, tell your mama, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.108" end="01:23.647">Tell your daddy (Tell 'em, boy, tell your daddy, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.647" end="01:26.515">Tell your mama (Tell 'em, boy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.515" end="01:28.015">Tell your daddy (Tell your daddy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.839" end="01:29.339" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Tell 'em boy, woah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.573" end="01:30.073" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.797" end="01:31.297">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.559" end="01:36.794">Like sugar on my tongue (Cannot stay away from you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.794" end="01:38.684">Like sugar on my tongue (Can I steal that before you go?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.684" end="01:40.512" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.512" end="01:44.489">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.489" end="01:50.629">You wanna get me up, you wanna be my friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.629" end="01:54.077">You wanna get me up, you'll never be my thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.077" end="01:58.189">I wanna take you down, you wanna be my thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.189" end="02:00.003">No, no, no, no, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.003" end="02:07.200">Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh (Ha, ha, ha, eat you up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.200" end="02:14.047">Oh, oh, oh, oh (Ha, ha, girl, I'll eat you up, ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.047" end="02:15.562">Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.562" end="02:17.062">Oh, oh, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.531" end="02:18.031" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.361" end="02:18.861">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.195" end="02:21.542">Huh, lemme just taste it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.542" end="02:24.028">Ain't gotta cuff from nothing (Eat you up, yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.028" end="02:29.039">I promise, I'll take you out on a date</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.039" end="02:33.039">Just trust me (Eat you up)</p></div></body></tt>